{"version":1,"content":"<p>據報道，受首款摺疊手機市場需求火爆帶動，蘋果已通知供應鏈廠商上調iPhone Duo的產能與訂單規模。報道援引業內人士消息稱：iPhone Duo於上周五正式開售，新機瞬間售罄；第二批出貨要等到2027年1月22日才會啓動。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583896.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T07:00:21.954244+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":117,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T06:42:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T06:58:07.067800+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T06:58:07.067800+00:00","content_hash":"10b7f0cf84f67b74d00575371d5bfc485780864f5a48e3b35a8f461a9c6c9487","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}